      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Under a balanced design (with N sires, M dams per sire, and n progeny per dam), the large-sample variance for $ t_{PHS} $ and $ t_{FS} $ can be obtained from formulae provided by Osborne and Paterson (1952),",
